+From 88b44ef78625f29c23f4888fb921f8871e5f16d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.ai>
+Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:02:40 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Replace mobile bottom bar with a floating liquid-glass
+ dock
+
+Redesign the phone/tablet navigation only, per FixPrompt.md:
+
+- Centred pill capsule that floats clear of the left, right and bottom
+  viewport edges, with safe-area-aware bottom spacing.
+- Liquid-glass surface (translucent bg, backdrop blur + saturation,
+  subtle border, layered shadow) with an opaque fallback for browsers
+  without backdrop-filter; tuned separately for light and dark themes.
+- Sliding active capsule measured from the rendered items, so tab
+  switches animate (transform/opacity only) and stay aligned across
+  resize, zoom and orientation changes.
+- Tactile press feedback on icons; Create keeps its distinct action
+  style; Profile shows the signed-in avatar ringed when active.
