+  z-50 modals and viewers).
+- Responsive dock tokens moved to :root inside the media
+  queries so the content-padding token picks them up too.
+
+Auto-hide on scroll down / instant return on upward scroll,
+glass styling, routes and all functionality unchanged.
+
